. esttab legacy7_1 legacy7_2 legacy7_3 legacy7_4 legacy7_5 legacy7_6 ///
>     using "$OUT/Table7_legacy_replication.csv", replace b(6) se(6) stats(N N_fa
> il)
(output written to C:/Users/user/Documents/VD/outputs/downstream_financing/Table7
> _legacy_replication.csv)

. restore

. * Four supporting estimands; separate outputs, no changes to innovation outcome
> s.
. version 19

. * Financing support analysis embedded directly in this master do-file.
. * Supporting evidence, not a mediation test. Post-treatment selection affects a
> mounts.
. * Build data with scripts/build_downstream_financing.py after updating source/c
> utoff.
. preserve

. local D "C:/Users/user/Documents/VD/outputs/downstream_financing"

. use "`D'/financing_support.dta", clear

. isid firm_id

. assert _N == 2820

. local X "VD i.patentdummybyfiling i.earlystage ln_MoneyRaised_VD NumofFundingRo
> unds_VD"

. local FE "i.Region2 i.Industry2 i.Foundingyear"

. display as text "SUPPORT ONLY: year-end reference, assumed coverage through 202
> 3-12-31."
SUPPORT ONLY: year-end reference, assumed coverage through 2023-12-31.

. display as text "Not exact time since VD; no competing-exit adjustment."
Not exact time since VD; no competing-exit adjustment.

. tempname P

. postfile `P' str32 model double b se N using "`D'/support_estimates.dta", repla
> ce

. * 1. Cumulative next-round probability at fixed horizons, robust LPM.
. * 4. ln(1 + cumulative USD), retaining no-round zeros under cutoff assumption.
. forvalues h=1/3 {
  2.     assert missing(raise`h') if complete`h' == 0
  3.     assert missing(cum`h') if undisclosed`h' == 1
  4.     reghdfe raise`h' `X', absorb(Region2 Industry2 Foundingyear) vce(robust)
  5.     post `P' ("probability_`h'y") (_b[VD]) (_se[VD]) (e(N))
  6.     estimates save "`D'/probability_`h'y.ster", replace
  7.     gen double ln_cum_usd`h' = ln(1 + cum`h')
  8.     assert ln_cum_usd`h' == 0 if cum`h' == 0
  9.     assert missing(ln_cum_usd`h') if missing(cum`h')
 10.     reghdfe ln_cum_usd`h' `X', absorb(Region2 Industry2 Foundingyear) vce(ro
> bust)
